sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Lead(人或 Lead agent)
  participant CLI as flywheel-comm hold
  participant R as runs-route.ts<br/>与 /hold /terminate 同一扇门
  participant S as StateStore<br/>canonicalizeHoldResume 单点算 digest
  participant REG as 19 种 hold 形状注册表
  L->>CLI: hold list --run X
  CLI->>R: GET /api/runs/X/holds(master token + loopback)
  R->>REG: 逐形状 detect(run X 的事件)
  REG-->>R: [{shape, resumable, 前置条件}]
  R-->>L: 列表
  L->>CLI: hold resume --run X --shape S --reason R
  CLI->>R: POST /resume/stage(body 不带 runId,路径为准)
  R->>S: canonicalizeHoldResume → {canonical, digest}
  R-->>CLI: confirmToken(绑 digest)
  CLI->>R: POST /resume(canonical + confirmToken)
  R->>S: 同一函数再算 digest,verifyAndConsume
  S->>REG: resume(S):前置条件重读 → 动作 → hold_resumed
  alt 前置不满足 / hold 已变
    S-->>L: 409 hold_changed(写 hold_resume_refused)
  else 成功
    S-->>L: run 回 active,同 clientRequestId 重放返回 idempotentReplay
  end
